        {
          "text": " Kogogonoto, kitodiasi ekiliokone, yes Ipilisitian, tetere mam iraunos ibulesin luka Iburanian, kwape lem eraatatar kesi lukus: kitodiasi ekiliokone, koiioto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.9",
