              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi kedolu, koany, eboie Eli koicoloŋoke kariri naka erot, kidari: naarai amarani eketau kanuka asaduku naka EJAKAIT, Kelomu etuŋanan ore, kolimo akirot, kodelo ere kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
