              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotie aberu naka okokuke Pinekas, koapie da aidoun: kepupu nin akiro ebe anatar asaduku naka Edeke, ido atwaka papaake ka okilenike, kokukum, kidou; naarai abu akeriebo kodolok ŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
