                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Napeapie ŋesi atwanare kolimokis ŋes aŋor nuabwoete kanen ebe, “Sirikikurianar, naarai idou esapat.” Konye mam abu Koboŋok, karaida apodokin, ",
